  "premise": "A traveler wants to hide a conspicuous patch on an old raincoat, repeatedly folding it out of sight. A childlike paper puppet places a tiny matching patch on its own cloak, and the traveler lets the coat hang naturally before adding a playful second patch shaped like a cloud.",
